      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;what-is-gn&#34;&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/tools/gn/+/48062805e19b4697c5fbd926dc649c78b6aaa138/README.md&#34;&gt;What is GN?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;</description>
